===Etymology===
From {{proto|Germanic|standanan|lang=ang}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|steh₂-|lang=ang}}.  Cognate with Old Frisian [[standa]], Old High German [[stantan]], Old Saxon [[standan#Old Saxon|standan]], Old Norse [[standa]], Gothic [[𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌽𐌳𐌰𐌽]].  The Germanic source is cognate with Greek {{l|grc|ἵστημι}}, Latin [[stare]], Old Irish [[tairissiur]], Old Slavic ''stojati'' (Russian [[стоять]]).

